# ai/pins.env: the ONE place for every version, commit sha and checksum of the `ai` setup.
# Rules: exact versions only (never @latest), a commit sha where a tool has no tags, a checksum for
# every download. A bump needs a new audit (docs/EXTENDING.md). Plain KEY=VALUE lines, sourced by
# bash 3.2 and read by python. No secrets here.
# Status words in comments: AUDITED = intake audit done; PROPOSED = latest release seen, audit owed.

